    "type": "game",
    "name": "Packed Lair",
    "steam_appid": 3489680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed Lair is a base building auto-battler roguelike where you place your buildings like in an inventory to create a powerful army of orcs, goblins and other monsters, then send them to defeat your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your buildings carefully </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building has its own power: Create minions, improve them or produce gold. After every wave, you will be able to buy new buildings from a random selection, dig yourself lair bigger or make room for new minions. Make the best choice to hold your enemies off long enough<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/2ca9f549385536304cb497f568bd4aa6.poster.avif?t=1750228964\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/2ca9f549385536304cb497f568bd4aa6.webm?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/2ca9f549385536304cb497f568bd4aa6.mp4?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let them fight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an evil lord, you have a lot of enemies. See your minions resisting against a ever growing battalion of different heroes: elves, dwarves, humans, ... but nothing stops you from throwing spells then and there while your minions are fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/ef0e89caa9171f4bb18ee652b1ed3264.poster.avif?t=1750228964\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/ef0e89caa9171f4bb18ee652b1ed3264.webm?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/ef0e89caa9171f4bb18ee652b1ed3264.mp4?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and Thrive </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you crush your enemies or did they crush you first ? No problem, you can always start anew with better buildings and improvments. There is always a volcano somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed Lair is a base building auto-battler roguelike where you place your buildings like in an inventory to create a powerful army of orcs, goblins and other monsters, then send them to defeat your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your buildings carefully </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building has its own power: Create minions, improve them or produce gold. After every wave, you will be able to buy new buildings from a random selection, dig yourself lair bigger or make room for new minions. Make the best choice to hold your enemies off long enough<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/2ca9f549385536304cb497f568bd4aa6.poster.avif?t=1750228964\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/2ca9f549385536304cb497f568bd4aa6.webm?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/2ca9f549385536304cb497f568bd4aa6.mp4?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let them fight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an evil lord, you have a lot of enemies. See your minions resisting against a ever growing battalion of different heroes: elves, dwarves, humans, ... but nothing stops you from throwing spells then and there while your minions are fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/ef0e89caa9171f4bb18ee652b1ed3264.poster.avif?t=1750228964\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/ef0e89caa9171f4bb18ee652b1ed3264.webm?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/ef0e89caa9171f4bb18ee652b1ed3264.mp4?t=1750228964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and Thrive </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you crush your enemies or did they crush you first ? No problem, you can always start anew with better buildings and improvments. There is always a volcano somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Villainous base-builder mixed with inventory management auto-battler roguelike! Draft buildings, pack them carefully into your cramped lair to create powerful synergies and send your army of minions to deal with the endless hero problem. Why won\u2019t they just leave you alone?",
